&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;An interactive resource guide for AI agent frameworks, tools, and infrastructure has been updated. Built for developers who ship, the resource is a Next.js 14 web application designed for searching, filtering, and exploring AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-overview"&gt;🔍 Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This resource provides the most comprehensive, structured guide to AI agent frameworks, tools, and resources, featuring side-by-side comparisons and weekly updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-key-details"&gt;⚙️ Key details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Tool/Framework&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;OpenAI Assistants API&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Orchestrates multi-agent systems with role-based collaboration&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Alibaba multi-agent framework&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Distributed deployment and fault tolerance for production use&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Claude SDK&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Official SDK with tool use, computer control, and streaming for Claude-native agents&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;AWS infrastructure&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Managed agents with Bedrock models, enterprise compliance, and auto-scaling deployment&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Semantic Kernel&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Event-driven multi-agent framework merged for production workflows&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Role-based simulation framework&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Multi-agent simulation for collaborative reasoning and task completion&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Multi-agent framework runtime&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Includes a control plane for managing agent deployments at scale&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
